---
import Base from '~/layouts/Base.astro';
import Station from '~/components/Station.astro';
---
<Base
  active="install"
  title="install emile — terminal coding agent"
  description="Install emile, configure your API provider, and send your first signal in under five minutes."
>
  <!-- ─── HERO ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-telegraph px-6 pt-16 sm:pt-24 pb-12">
    <div class="text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-signal text-[0.6875rem] mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 bg-copper"></span>
      <span>station · install · 04 · minutes</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="font-display text-5xl sm:text-6xl leading-[0.95] tracking-tight">
      Get on the wire<br/>
      <span class="text-copper">in five minutes.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-8 text-lg text-ink-soft max-w-prose leading-relaxed">
      Node 18+, one provider key, three commands. No native modules, no build,
      no surprises.
    </p>
  </section>

  <hr />

  <!-- ─── 01 · REQUIREMENTS ───────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <Station index="01" label="requirements" caption="what you need">
    <ul class="space-y-3 text-ink-soft font-mono">
      <li class="flex gap-4">
        <span class="text-copper shrink-0">▸</span>
        <span><span class="text-ink uppercase tracking-signal text-[0.6875rem]">node</span> · 18 or newer (uses native ES modules and <code class="text-copper">fetch</code>)</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex gap-4">
        <span class="text-copper shrink-0">▸</span>
        <span><span class="text-ink uppercase tracking-signal text-[0.6875rem]">os</span> · linux or macOS. Windows works wherever Node does.</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex gap-4">
        <span class="text-copper shrink-0">▸</span>
        <span><span class="text-ink uppercase tracking-signal text-[0.6875rem]">key</span> · an API key for one of: <code class="text-copper">requesty</code>, <code class="text-copper">openrouter</code>, <code class="text-copper">opencode</code>, <code class="text-copper">opencode-go</code>. Any OpenAI-compatible endpoint works.</span>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </Station>

  <!-- ─── 02 · INSTALL ─────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <Station index="02" label="install" caption="three commands">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl mb-3">From npm</h3>
        <div class="border border-ink-line bg-graphite text-cream p-5 font-mono text-sm overflow-x-auto">
<pre>$ git clone https://github.com/mc33p/emile-cli.git
$ cd emile-cli
$ npm install
$ npm link    <span class="text-graphite-ghost"># makes `emile` global</span></pre>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl mt-8 mb-3">Without linking</h3>
        <div class="border border-ink-line bg-graphite text-cream p-5 font-mono text-sm overflow-x-auto">
<pre>$ node bin/emile.js</pre>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl mb-3">Check the version</h3>
        <div class="border border-ink-line bg-graphite text-cream p-5 font-mono text-sm overflow-x-auto">
<pre>$ emile --version
<span class="text-graphite-ghost">emile 1.0.0</span></pre>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
          If the command isn't found, your global <code class="text-copper">node_modules/.bin</code> isn't on
          <code class="text-copper">PATH</code>. Run <code class="text-copper">npm config get prefix</code> and add its
          <code class="text-copper">bin</code> directory to your shell profile.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Station>

  <!-- ─── 03 · CONNECT ────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <Station index="03" label="connect" caption="pick a provider">
    <p class="text-ink-soft max-w-prose mb-8">
      On first run, the wizard walks you through it. Or set environment variables
      and skip the prompts.
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-3">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl">option · A</h3>
          <span class="tag">wizard</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-soft mb-3">Run <code class="text-copper">emile</code> and answer three prompts.</p>
        <div class="border border-ink-line bg-graphite text-cream p-4 font-mono text-xs">
<pre>▸ pick a provider (requesty, openrouter, …)
▸ paste your api key
▸ pick a default model</pre>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-3">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl">option · B</h3>
          <span class="tag tag--copper">env · vars</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-soft mb-3">Drop these in your shell profile.</p>
        <div class="border border-ink-line bg-graphite text-cream p-4 font-mono text-xs">
<pre>export EMILE_PROVIDER=requesty
export REQUESTY_API_KEY=sk-…
export EMILE_DEFAULT_MODEL=anthropic/claude-3.5-sonnet
export EMILE_DEFAULT_EFFORT=low</pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Station>

  <!-- ─── 04 · FIRST SIGNAL ───────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <Station index="04" label="first · signal" caption="send your first message">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-start">
      <div>
        <p class="text-ink-soft mb-6">
          You're connected. Pick a mode and start typing.
        </p>
        <ol class="space-y-4 font-mono text-sm">
          <li>
            <span class="text-copper">▸ interactive</span>
            <div class="border border-ink-line bg-graphite text-cream px-4 py-2 mt-1 inline-block">emile</div>
            <p class="mt-1 text-ink-muted text-xs">Opens the REPL. Type <code class="text-copper">/</code> for slash commands.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="text-copper">▸ one-shot</span>
            <div class="border border-ink-line bg-graphite text-cream px-4 py-2 mt-1 inline-block">emile "add validation to src/api.js"</div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="text-copper">▸ plan · first</span>
            <div class="border border-ink-line bg-graphite text-cream px-4 py-2 mt-1 inline-block">emile -p "build a REST API for a todo app"</div>
            <p class="mt-1 text-ink-muted text-xs">The agent drafts a plan and waits for approval before touching files.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="text-copper">▸ model · override</span>
            <div class="border border-ink-line bg-graphite text-cream px-4 py-2 mt-1 inline-block">emile -m openai/gpt-4o -e high "refactor auth module"</div>
            <p class="mt-1 text-ink-muted text-xs"><code class="text-copper">-e</code> dials reasoning effort: low · medium · high · max.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="text-copper">▸ resume · session</span>
            <div class="border border-ink-line bg-graphite text-cream px-4 py-2 mt-1 inline-block">emile -H</div>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <aside class="card">
        <div class="ticker mb-4">
          <span>flags · cheatsheet</span>
          <span class="text-ink-muted">v1.0</span>
        </div>
        <dl class="font-mono text-xs space-y-2">
          <div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><dt class="text-copper">-m, --model</dt><dd class="text-ink">model id (provider-prefixed)</dd></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><dt class="text-copper">-e, --effort</dt><dd class="text-ink">low · med · high · max · min · none</dd></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><dt class="text-copper">-p, --plans</dt><dd class="text-ink">plan mode (approval before writes)</dd></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><dt class="text-copper">--no-cache</dt><dd class="text-ink">bypass prompt caching</dd></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><dt class="text-copper">-s, --skills</dt><dd class="text-ink">comma list of skills to enable</dd></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><dt class="text-copper">-H, --history</dt><dd class="text-ink">resume a past session</dd></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><dt class="text-copper">--no-safe</dt><dd class="text-ink">bypass shell safe-mode</dd></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><dt class="text-copper">--dry-run</dt><dd class="text-ink">simulate writes and commands</dd></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><dt class="text-copper">--export-thinking</dt><dd class="text-ink">include reasoning in /export</dd></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><dt class="text-copper">--max-session-size</dt><dd class="text-ink">bytes (default 10 MiB)</dd></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><dt class="text-copper">--verbose</dt><dd class="text-ink">show setup & debug logs</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </Station>

  <!-- ─── 05 · UNDO & SAFETY ──────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <Station index="05" label="undo · & · safety" caption="staying in control">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <article class="card">
        <div class="text-copper uppercase tracking-signal text-[0.6875rem] mb-3">⏵ safe · mode</div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl mb-2">Approve destructive commands.</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-soft">
          By default, anything that mutates outside your working directory prompts
          you. Bypass with <code class="text-copper">--no-safe</code> at your own risk.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <div class="text-copper uppercase tracking-signal text-[0.6875rem] mb-3">⏵ dry · run</div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl mb-2">Simulate without touching.</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-soft">
          <code class="text-copper">--dry-run</code> shows what the agent would do — file
          edits, shell invocations — and writes nothing.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <div class="text-copper uppercase tracking-signal text-[0.6875rem] mb-3">⏵ /undo</div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl mb-2">Rewind any change.</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-soft">
          Inside the REPL: <code class="text-copper">/undo</code> reverts the last
          edit; <code class="text-copper">/undo 3</code> reverts three.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </Station>

  <!-- ─── 06 · TROUBLESHOOT ───────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <Station index="06" label="troubleshoot" caption="when the wire is noisy">
    <div class="space-y-6 text-sm font-mono">
      <div>
        <div class="text-copper uppercase tracking-signal text-[0.6875rem] mb-1">/cost shows huge numbers</div>
        <p class="text-ink-soft">Your context is bloated. Drop in <code class="text-copper">/switch</code> for a
        cheaper model, raise reasoning effort on small tasks, or compress history.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-copper uppercase tracking-signal text-[0.6875rem] mb-1">command keeps getting blocked</div>
        <p class="text-ink-soft">Safe mode is doing its job. Run <code class="text-copper">emile --no-safe "…"</code>
        explicitly for one session, or add the command to your project's allowed list.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-copper uppercase tracking-signal text-[0.6875rem] mb-1">model disconnects mid-task</div>
        <p class="text-ink-soft">The client retries transient failures. If the retry budget is spent,
        you'll see a clear error — no silent data loss.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-copper uppercase tracking-signal text-[0.6875rem] mb-1">something else</div>
        <p class="text-ink-soft">Open an issue on
          <a class="text-copper hover:underline" href="https://github.com/mc33p/emile-cli/issues" rel="noopener">github ↗</a>
          with the output of <code class="text-copper">emile --verbose</code>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Station>

  <!-- ─── CTA ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-telegraph px-6 pb-24">
    <div class="border border-ink-line bg-paper-warm p-8 sm:p-12">
      <div class="ticker mb-6">
        <span>end · of · install</span>
        <span class="text-ink-muted">signal · clear</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl tracking-tight leading-[0.95]">
        You're on the wire.<br/>
        <span class="text-copper">Send something.</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="/" class="btn">back · to · signal</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/mc33p/emile-cli" class="btn btn--copper" rel="noopener">read · source · ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
